{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1163555-mage-the-awakening-2nd-edition-actual-play-boston-lights","id":1163555,"title":"[Mage: the Awakening 2nd Edition Actual Play] Boston Lights","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-11-29T07:59:40-08:00","id":1163555,"title":"[Mage: the Awakening 2nd Edition Actual Play] Boston Lights","content":"Hello, everyone! I come bearing content, in the form of a Mage: the Awakening 2nd Edition Actual Play. We're using Boston Unveiled, modified heavily, and set in the modern day. The game is played via Discord chat with a dicebot, and the goal is to update at once a week, or roughly in that area. The information is in the PDF. And it's going to be just me sharing links to PDFs with you, because the advanced editor on here gives me conniptions.<br /> <br /> Anyway, please enjoy the first session of our campaign, Boston Lights. Critique, comment, inquire, bully, validate all the time I spent editing, transcribing, organizing, and proofreading this. This link will take you to the full version of the AP, with the latest session included. Feel free to point out any errors or eyesores.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1CByoV4vqwSqZZw53Kbsg_oN9gHdFdosz\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/open?id=1CB...sg_oN9gHdFdosz</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":18038,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18038-traffichazard","user":"TrafficHazard","date":". 01-20-2018, 12:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18038-traffichazard","name":"TrafficHazard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18038_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-03T19:36:55-08:00","id":1164950,"title":"","content":"So as it turns out, swagdog is a pretty great artist, and has done up portraits of each of our characters.<br /> <br /> Lucius :<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1fAX5HdZK0aAtJbUtVIBFYxtlMl8XgcMe\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/open?id=1fA...BFYxtlMl8XgcMe</a><br /> Lupin: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1puG0eTdOWbc-Dr8A8gwtkWPhpZp3kc97\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/open?id=1pu...wtkWPhpZp3kc97</a><br /> And House (WIP): <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1x6mt2p3d6D3UyynbAwD7ybb8qGzAvBDY\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/open?id=1x6...D7ybb8qGzAvBDY</a><br /> <br /> Pretty good, right? The next session is tomorrow, so there should be an upload around the day after. Thanks for reading!<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18038-traffichazard","name":"TrafficHazard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18038_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-04T10:00:27-08:00","id":1165082,"title":"","content":"Nice. I really like how Lucius and Lupin are two sourpusses, while House knows he's awesome, and he's not even going to hide it. You can guess their social dynamics from merely three pictures.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-05T14:10:39-08:00","id":1165420,"title":"","content":"I'm pretty fond of the pictures myself. Really good.<br /> <br /> Anyway, here's the next session! Very exciting stuff.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1MwtRhGSN4a8F5Q89R9hwVCHc31PDt_T3\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1MwtRhGSN4a8F5Q89R9hwVCHc31PDt_T3\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1MwtRhGSN4a8F5Q89R9hwVCHc31PDt_T3\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/open?id=1MwtRhGSN4a8F5Q89R9hwVCHc31PDt_T3 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18038-traffichazard","name":"TrafficHazard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18038_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-10T15:11:11-08:00","id":1166543,"title":"","content":"Just an update, I realize this isn't exactly the most actively, uh, active project here. Next session is tomorrow, and I've combined both sessions into one document for your convenience:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1QYA3lo1Duv1KNHw1F170ej4yaqUC-La-\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1QYA3lo1Duv1KNHw1F170ej4yaqUC-La-\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1QYA3lo1Duv1KNHw1F170ej4yaqUC-La-\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/open?id=1QYA3lo1Duv1KNHw1F170ej4yaqUC-La- </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Changes have been made to each document (and so by extension to this one). Nothing major, changed the title to look like our &quot;High Speech&quot; (which has been changed a little itself), incorporated character art, some errors were fixed and included some info towards the end that was forgotten the time first time around.<br /> <br /> To everyone who is reading, I'd like to say thanks. I hope you're enjoying everything so far, we're definitely having fun playing it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18038-traffichazard","name":"TrafficHazard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18038_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-13T10:45:19-08:00","id":1167351,"title":"","content":"Just checking in to say I adore a good Actual Play and am looking forward to the next instalment!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6230-katana1515","name":"Katana1515","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6230_2.jpeg","t