jiryozyt9MOvjsGoACjjugfwZgkDf-\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=11Hjiryozyt9MOvjsGoACjjugfwZgkDf-\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=11Hjiryozyt9MOvjsGoACjjugfwZgkDf-\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/open?id=11Hjiryozyt9MOvjsGoACjjugfwZgkDf- </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18038-traffichazard","name":"TrafficHazard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18038_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-27T16:58:31-08:00","id":1171101,"title":"","content":"Man, tense, good stuff.<br /> <br /> It's interesting, I don't think I've ever read a Mage AP where cabal members didn't end up hating each other at least a little bit for a while.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-13T00:25:05-08:00","id":1175709,"title":"","content":"Alright, new session is written up. Enjoy!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1gTbYTCvbfNIwDFv5ZQ6G2aeKVMuVsf8C\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1gTbYTCvbfNIwDFv5ZQ6G2aeKVMuVsf8C\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1gTbYTCvbfNIwDFv5ZQ6G2aeKVMuVsf8C\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/open?id=1gTbYTCvbfNIwDFv5ZQ6G2aeKVMuVsf8C </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18038-traffichazard","name":"TrafficHazard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18038_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-13T08:15:08-08:00","id":1175761,"title":"","content":"Lupin seems to step from one indignity into another. How much of it is intended by his player?<br /> <br /> Also, I really liked the exchange between House and Potestas. A difference of world-views between an inexperienced Mage an an Archmaster way over his head? Strong stuff!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-13T09:27:10-08:00","id":1175776,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Teatime</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1163555-mage-the-awakening-2nd-edition-actual-play-boston-lights?p=1175761#post1175761\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Lupin seems to step from one indignity into another. How much of it is intended by his player?</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty much all of it. It's a mix of deliberately taken dramatic failures and dumb moves taken even though I know full well that they're dumb. Also I really liked that exchange as well.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18038-traffichazard","name":"TrafficHazard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18038_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-13T15:42:23-08:00","id":1175854,"title":"","content":"Rad.<br /> <br /> Thanks for these!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5958-logocentric","name":"Logocentric","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5958_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T21:18:15-08:00","id":1179099,"title":"","content":"Here's the newest update!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1V8reIkYAwAY4qZ7GL00WdbQBX-2lhfgs\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1V8reIkYAwAY4qZ7GL00WdbQBX-2lhfgs\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1V8reIkYAwAY4qZ7GL00WdbQBX-2lhfgs\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/open?id=1V8reIkYAwAY4qZ7GL00WdbQBX-2lhfgs </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18038-traffichazard","name":"TrafficHazard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18038_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-28T03:55:56-08:00","id":1180117,"title":"","content":"Hello World!<br /> <br /> I am swagdog, the player fortunate enough to portray House in this fantastic ongoing AP Storytold by BestBert and starring my friends TrafficHazard (as Lupin) and CoolStory (as Lucius). <br /> <br /> It's a thrillride to play with these guys. I like to think we've become fast friends in a short amount of time - before this game, we didn't even know each other! All of this has been powered by the internet. I know personally I've lucked out to meet fine gentlemen such as these. They have good taste, are scholars of English horses, riders of fine literature all. Is this the power of Mage: the Awakening? To bring Renaissance men together and force them to play with rubes like me? <br /> <br /> I'd like to thank everyone who has been reading so far. Your input, feedback, criticism and advice is truly appreciated. I'd love to answer any questions you might have, and hopefully I'll have an opportunity to shed some light behind the scenes of this AP, if the chance arises. I'm grateful for your participation in this strange AP house we're slowly building together.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23778-swagdog","name":"swagdog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23778_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-09T11:21:33-08:00","id":1184018,"title":"","content":"Hello everyone, just checking in. We're all pretty tied up at the moment, and haven't managed to settle on a good time for all of us to play. We're not calling it quits though! Sorry for the delay!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18038-traffichazard","name":"TrafficHazard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18038_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-10T04:30:14-08:00","id":1184324,"title":"","content":"It's the nature of such things. Don't mind us. We'll just be here, waiting. :P<br /> <br /> Seriously though you guys are producing a great story and I'm looking forward to the next installment.<br /> <br /> Out of curiosity, what would you say your favourite moment or scene or snippet of lore or general shenanigan has been so far?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23592-aurelius","name":"Aurelius","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23592_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-10T06:18:44-08:00","id":1184358,"title":"","content":"I really can't choose, and talking about the stuff I've made is both blowing my own horn, and has the potential to give away future plot points.<br /> <br /> I really, really liked running the introductory session. Lucius arriving and inadvertently making connections, Lupin headbutting his way through a Wraith's trial, and House making nice-nice between them all.<br /> The guys managed to pull together a really nice 'how we became a Cabal' story.<br /> <br /> The recent scene between Avaratia and Lupin was also a lot of fun for me. A Mage who's powerful enough to impose their will on a PC, but not held back by the fear of Mysterium retaliation. Also some nice Mentor-Student strife.<br /> <br /> The conversation between House and the strange man with the journal (Baldo) was also neat. Should be fun to see where that goes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12644-herbertisbestbert","name":"HerbertIsBestBert","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12644_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"312"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-10T10:36:28-08:00","id":1184445,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aurelius</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1163555-mage-the-awakening-2nd-edition-actual-play-boston-lights?p=1184324#post1184324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Out of curiosity, what would you say your favourite moment or scene or snippet of lore or general shenanigan has been so far?</div> </div> </div> </div>It really is hard to say. I've fallen in with a bunch of pretty talented roleplayers (BestBert as ST included), but overall I'd have to say the introductory session as well. How PCs come together is often a tricky part to figure out, from what I've gathered, and I think we pulled it off pretty well. We established all the building blocks. Our position and situation in the Caucus, the general roles our characters have (Lucius = Intellectual, House = Face, Lupin = Guts) and now as we move forward, we're starting to see how we balance each other out and temper each other, in a sense. All the PCs have made mistakes (perhaps some more than others, *cough*) but we're learning, and I have the feeling the Lamplighters are going to hit their stride pretty soon.<br /> <br /> P.S: Thanks for the support!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18038-traffichazard","name":"TrafficHazard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18038_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-14T13:37:57-08:00","id":1186057,"title":"","content":"A random question: What is Lucius' stats? I'm auoer interested in the character's Magical acumen, seeing how it's a bit more developed than the others in certain ways.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8573-zombiecakes","name":"Zombiecakes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-14T18:00:23-08:00","id":1186141,"title":"","content":"Shadow Name: Lucius<br /> Sympathetic Name: ????? ?????<br /> Order: Mysterium<br /> Legacy: Eyes of Ain Soph<br /> <br /> Gnosis: 2<br /> Prime: 3<br /> Forces: 2<br /> Mind: 1<br /> <br /> Intelligence: 4<br /> Wits: 2<br /> Resolve: 3<br /> <br /> Strength, Dexterity, and Stamina: 2<br /> <br /> Presence and Manipulation: 2<br /> Composure: 3<br /> <br /> Academics: 2 (Research)<br /> Investigation: 2<br /> Occult: 5<br /> Politics: 1<br /> Science: 2 (Physics)<br /> <br /> Athletics: 2 (Aimed Spells)<br /> Stealth: 1<br /> Survival: 1<br /> <br /> Expression: 2<br /> Empathy, Intimidation, Persuasion, Socialize, Subterfuge: 1<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18038-traffichazard","name":"TrafficHazard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18038_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-17T03:35:32-08:00","id":1186995,"title":"","content":"Hey, TrafficHazard, I just wanted to pop in and tell you, that I am extremely enjoying your session write ups. They are of supreme quality and if not for a fact that I know that these are session write ups, I would have thought that a professional Onyx path writer is writing fan fiction. <br /> <br /> The chemistry of your players is perfect ! I love every single one of them.<br /> <br /> Please do not stop.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1013-stralos","name":"Stralos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1013_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-17T21:42:27-08:00","id":1187209,"title":"","content":"Thanks! But they aren't *my* players. I'm actually Lupin's player. I just write up the sessions. HerbertIsBestBert is the ST. And we definitely don't have any plans to stop!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18038-traffichazard","name":"TrafficHazard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18038_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-03T05:23:57-08:00","id":1191311,"title":"","content":"Update: S O O N.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18038-traffichazard","name":"TrafficHazard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18038_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-03T08:09:17-08:00","id":1191345,"title":"","content":"You guys are fun, thanks for posting all this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12596-alpharius","name":"Alpharius","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12596_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-06T10:37:12-08:00","id":1192311,"title":"","content":"Sorry for the wait, but here's the latest session!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1dR-4L9H2dwNiVoIxkAskIjru64y9ngXQ\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1dR-4L9H2dwNiVoIxkAskIjru64y9ngXQ\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1dR-4L9H2dwNiVoIxkAskIjru64y9ngXQ\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/open?id=1dR-4L9H2dwNiVoIxkAskIjru64y9ngXQ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18038-traffichazard","name":"TrafficHazard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18038_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T08:29:05-07:00","id":1197206,"title":"","content":"Hey, all. Sorry for the delay, again, but real life is making fools of us all. This game is still active, and we're playing in bits and pieces when we can (benefits of an online game), but nothing substantial enough to post just yet. We're just having difficulty finding a time that's good for everyone. But soon!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18038-traffichazard","name":"TrafficHazard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18038_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T10:27:20-07:00","id":1200859,"title":"","content":"Thanks for your patience, friends. Here we have the next chunk of twists and turns! Thrills, chills, kills...the ride continues! Enjoy!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1x603Cz9OVwTO-56wSsZS3vu4uZmJqGE8/view\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1x603Cz9OVwTO-56wSsZS3vu4uZmJqGE8/view\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1x603Cz9OVwTO-56wSsZS3vu4uZmJqGE8/view\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/file/d/1x603Cz9OVwTO-56wSsZS3vu4uZmJqGE8/view </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23778-swagdog","name":"swagdog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23778_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T10:29:55-07:00","id":1200862,"title":"","content":"Well, that's embarrassing. Double posting! I guess I was really excited.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23778,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23778-swagdog","user":"swagdog","date":".  The forum held a gun to my head and made me post twice. 03-29-2018, 01:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23778-swagdog","name":"swagdog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23778_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T16:15:35-07:00","id":1201039,"title":"","content":"And I was about to go to sleep, too.... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23592-aurelius","name":"Aurelius","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23592_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T19:20:55-07:00","id":1201119,"title":"","content":"Apart from the lack of using past tense in a freaking story, your latest addition is INCREDIBLE! I'm eating this up like it's freshly baked bread with butter and an extra large helping of honey on top. MMMMMM!!! EXQUISITE!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7825-falcon777","name":"Falcon777","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-03T01:45:20-07:00","id":1202493,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Falcon777</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1163555-mage-the-awakening-2nd-edition-actual-play-boston-lights?p=1201119#post1201119\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Apart from the lack of using past tense in a freaking story, your latest addition is INCREDIBLE! I'm eating this up like it's freshly baked bread with butter and an extra large helping of honey on top. MMMMMM!!! EXQUISITE!</div> </div> </div> </div>While rare, stories can be written in present tense <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Otherwise, I agree with this statement wholeheartedly. This was amazing to read and I can't wait to see how it continues.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/20475-bethris","name":"Bethris","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar20475_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-05T00:37:13-07:00","id":1203317,"title":"","content":"Thank you for the incredible support, friends! We're really happy and fortunate to be able to continue to produce this AP in the format that it is. To peel back the curtain just a smidgen, since everything we write is in real time, it felt very natural for us to write in the present tense. I wouldn't say it was a conscious choice for us - believe it or not, there were a fair amount of decisions and choices that were simply intuited by our troupe, and it's just been our luck that it's come out (mostly) readable! Well - luck doesn't have everything to do with it. Superior editing from TrafficHazard and a careful literary thru-line from our ST ensure that it is presented in a format that can be enjoyed. New developments will be coming sooner or later! For now, though, if you've got input, questions, concerns, curiosities, or just want to chat, let us know!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23778-swagdog","name":"swagdog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23778_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-10T21:16:12-07:00","id":1205457,"title":"","content":"Just caught up. This is fantastic. As a ST planning a campaign to start soon, I wish I knew how much is ST pre-planning and how much is spontaneous. :-) Maybe we'll find out eventually.<br /> <br /> Keep it up, folks! Love it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8721-taralx","name":"taralx","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-11T14:30:31-07:00","id":1205755,"title":"","content":"There's a fair bit of planning, I've spent many a slow hour pondering the interactions of characters and how to proceed in the game.<br /> Planning is also only advantaged by asking your players what they want to do, and what they want in general.<br /> From there you can play into, or subvert their expectations for characters and events.<br /> <br /> But even given all that preparation, this is Mage, where players have significant capacity to subvert expectations, so you've got to stay flexible.<br /> I like to keep my ideas floating around, so if something's not going to work, you throw it out and choose something else.<br /> <br /> You can also throw in something that you didn't plan for, but which suits the kind of scene you're in.<br /> Like a certain Seer deciding to desperately try and take out an immediate rival by getting murdery.<br /> <br /> It helps when you have players as invested as TrafficHazard, CoolStory, and swagdog are.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12644,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12644-herbertisbestbert","user":"HerbertIsBestBert","date":". 04-12-2018, 06:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12644-herbertisbestbert","name":"HerbertIsBestBert","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12644_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"312"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-13T13:54:02-07:00","id":1206636,"title":"","content":"I'd like to thank you for putting this together. Personally, one of the greatest challenges to CofD games is &quot;how is this done right?&quot; And Mage is a sterling example of a high hurdle in that area. It's just so dense!<br /> <br /> So seeing it played &quot;in action&quot; is super-helpful. Also much appreciated is how all of the characters are trying to get by with as much civility and decorum as possible, without resorting to murder or violation or bodily harm as their first prop for stressful situations. Well.. except for that one time. <br /> <br /> This makes the play seem more natural, in that the vast majority of the people we interact with wouldn't seriously dream of violent harm to solve their problems, even if they could through reality-bending magic.<br /> <br /> Cheers, and keep at it!<br /> --Khanwulf","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12493-khanwulf","name":"Khanwulf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12493_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"898"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-13T17:45:26-07:00","id":1206742,"title":"","content":"I love this actual play ! I think my favourite boy is House <br /> By the way i'm curious to know how did you handle the attainement for the eyes of Ain soph ? Can Lucius automaticaly detect lies ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12946-emerick","name":"Emerick","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12946_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-13T23:50:04-07:00","id":1206802,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Emerick</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1163555-mage-the-awakening-2nd-edition-actual-play-boston-lights?p=1206742#post1206742\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I love this actual play ! I think my favourite boy is House<br /> By the way i'm curious to know how did you handle the attainement for the eyes of Ain soph ? Can Lucius automaticaly detect lies ?</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, I did a full update for the Eyes of Ain Soph. I've done actually quite a few Legacy updates (and I'm currently working on the Keepers of the Covenant).<br /> I made them a Prime-only Legacy, due to the 2e changes to the Spirit Arcanum meaning that it's only one aspect of the bountiful 'Fallen' Magics that exist throught the world.<br /> <br /> Their first Attainment, the Seeker's Eye thus provides them two abilities.<br /> First, they gain a perpetual version of the spell Supernal Vision, whereby all they have to do is spent the turn scrutinizing something, and they get to ask question about its connection to the Supernal, equal to their dots in Prime. However we didn't really think that was enough, given that that can easily be done with a Prime 1 spell, with no risk of Paradox, Quiescence, or Acts of Hubris.<br /> So second, we tacked on a persistent Pierce Deception effect. Such that whenever a Seeker is lied to, they will know. Sure they don't know what the 'truth' is, but they know something is fishy, and has tried to pollute the Fallen with a little more deception and falsehood.<br /> <br /> This of course, means that advanced members of the Eyes of Ain Soph might get a bit world-weary.<br /> All Mages have to deal with the constant pressure of knowing secrets the world cannot.<br /> However the Eyes, one and all, have to deal with the constant barrage of the little lies which the world tells every day.<br /> <br /> Their second Attainment grants them a persistent veil for all Supernatural effects currently on, or affecting their person, as well as imposing a base Withstand on all spells seeking to affect them, of 2 (3 at Prime 4).<br /> <br /> Basically, the first two Attainments are tools that every Prime Mage will want to have, but will have to worry about maintaining, or using spell control for.<br /> The Eyes, in their devotion to the root of Magic, learn to weave those protections and tools into their very Gnosis.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12644-herbertisbestbert","name":"HerbertIsBestBert","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12644_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"312"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-14T08:21:39-07:00","id":1206885,"title":"","content":"It's very interesting, i'm trying to come up with a prime legacy for my mage and i have some trouble with the attainements the base guidelines isn't really usefull and i like that your seeker have some abilities always on instead of having to acrivate them again and again","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12946-emerick","name":"Emerick","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12946_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-14T09:23:27-07:00","id":1206911,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Emerick</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1163555-mage-the-awakening-2nd-edition-actual-play-boston-lights?p=1206885#post1206885\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's very interesting, i'm trying to come up with a prime legacy for my mage and i have some trouble with the attainements the base guidelines isn't really usefull and i like that your seeker have some abilities always on instead of having to acrivate them again and again</div> </div> </div> </div>Especially for Duration Primary attainments the problem of reactivation decreases exponentially as dots in arcana increase.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-18T05:10:17-07:00","id":1208398,"title":"","content":"We will have some new content for you soon, friends! The Boston Council! A summoning! Clandestine revelations! Halfway subtle intrigue! And a fight you might have guessed was coming...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23778-swagdog","name":"swagdog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23778_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-18T08:40:34-07:00","id":1208463,"title":"","content":"I hope House is okay D: ! He's probably okay, the House always wins after all !","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12946-emerick","name":"Emerick","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12946_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-19T21:06:06-07:00","id":1209112,"title":"","content":"Sorry for the delay, but here's the latest session! <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1R7p8OU5BsrYBrz2A36ExF_jAlIuJ1NU6\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/open?id=1R7...ExF_jAlIuJ1NU6</a><br /> <br /> A quick and dirty introduction to the Council - really tense stuff, tons of fun to play. It's a toss-up between Sunjata and Numa, for my favorite councilor. Who was yours? And that summoning, dope. swagdog needs to quit hogging all the good scenes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18038-traffichazard","name":"TrafficHazard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18038_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-20T06:19:29-07:00","id":1209214,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TrafficHazard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1163555-mage-the-awakening-2nd-edition-actual-play-boston-lights?p=1209112#post1209112\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry for the delay, but here's the latest session! <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1R7p8OU5BsrYBrz2A36ExF_jAlIuJ1NU6\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/open?id=1R7...ExF_jAlIuJ1NU6</a><br /> <br /> A quick and dirty introduction to the Council - really tense stuff, tons of fun to play. It's a toss-up between Sunjata and Numa, for my favorite councilor. Who was yours? And that summoning, dope. swagdog needs to quit hogging all the good scenes.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd go with Numa or Sunjata as favorites of the Councillors. The summoning was great and I guess there's a reason their username is &quot;swagdog&quot; =p I like how impulsive Lupin is xD","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/20475-bethris","name":"Bethris","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar20475_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-20T07:15:08-07:00","id":1209231,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Emerick</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1163555-mage-the-awakening-2nd-edition-actual-play-boston-lights?p=1208463#post1208463\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hope House is okay D: ! He's probably okay, the House always wins after all !</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Probably okay&quot; is just about as good as a mage can ask for, given these specific circumstances, huh? I guess &quot;okay&quot; is a relative quantity, too. He survived! That'll have to be good enough. Have you noticed everyone telling him how lucky he is, lately?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bethris</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1163555-mage-the-awakening-2nd-edition-actual-play-boston-lights?p=1209214#post1209214\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'd go with Numa or Sunjata as favorites of the Councillors. The summoning was great and I guess there's a reason their username is &quot;swagdog&quot; =p I like how impulsive Lupin is xD</div> </div> </div> </div>I like how impulsive Lupin is, too. For me, the interaction between Lupin and Lucius was the highlight of this subchapter. It really cemented how out of hand things had gotten inside of a week. Lupin is at once impulsive and hyperfocused, which to me says a lot about how well TrafficHazard plays a younger Mastigos dealing with a hell of a lot of pressure and moving parts. It's hard for him to deal with someone like Lucius, who has a lot of his pride at stake when it comes to how the Lamplighter's deal with the Company, but his personal stakes are a lot lower...and yet makes executive decisions swiftly anyway. Anyone would be frustrated, I imagine, in Lupin's position.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23778-swagdog","name":"swagdog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23778_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-20T16:48:11-07:00","id":1209454,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>swagdog</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1163555-mage-the-awakening-2nd-edition-actual-play-boston-lights?p=1209231#post1209231\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anyone would be frustrated, I imagine, in Lupin's position.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's been a rough week for Lupin. He's been psychically tortured, he sees his Sleeper friend after months of no contact, who then gets kidnapped, which Lupin blames himself for, then he accidentally gets his ex involved in things, his mentor mind controls him and tells him to solve a century-old Mystery for his initiation, then House almost gets murdered, and now Seers are sniffing around... again, threatening to ruin somebody's Awakening.<br /> <br /> (Recruited by Seers = ruined Awakening, to Lupin's eyes.)<br /> <br /> So yeah, the guy is at the end of his rope. And Lucius was there, just acting so very punchable.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18038-traffichazard","name":"TrafficHazard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18038_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-13T23:28:13-07:00","id":1218424,"title":"","content":"Update (and something else) SOON","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18038-traffichazard","name":"TrafficHazard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18038_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-16T18:41:33-07:00","id":1219503,"title":"","content":"Sorry for the wait, but we've got a pretty beefy update for you this time. It's the climax of Becoming Foolish, and the mystery around the Stone Assembly deepens. We'll also have something else for you, SOON.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1a0daj3RAWrYF8HSJsCdu7lXDAlYuAAdW\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1a0daj3RAWrYF8HSJsCdu7lXDAlYuAAdW\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1a0daj3RAWrYF8HSJsCdu7lXDAlYuAAdW\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/open?id=1a0daj3RAWrYF8HSJsCdu7lXDAlYuAAdW </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18038-traffichazard","name":"TrafficHazard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18038_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-17T06:03:40-07:00","id":1219602,"title":"","content":"Oh wow...so the Seer is...probably the jerk that was with Vision before. Huh.<br /> <br /> In any case, please keep up the good work! This is really good stuff!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7825-falcon777","name":"Falcon777","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-26T15:14:13-07:00","id":1222316,"title":"","content":"Hello, everyone. I have some bad news. Due to sudden IRL complications with the majority of our group, our uploads will most likely be scarce in the immediate future. We'll upload when we've got something to upload, which is the best I can promise you. We aren't quitting the project (we're having too much fun to do that), we're just asking you to bear with us until we can get things back on track.<br /> <br /> Thanks again, for all your support!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18038-traffichazard","name":"TrafficHazard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18038_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-30T16:37:02-07:00","id":1240635,"title":"","content":"Hey everyone, even worse news.<br /> While we've made some progress since the last update, our sessions have been brought to a complete stop by the disappearance of TrafficHazard.<br /> <br /> We're dedicated to keeping the game going but Traffic was the beating heart of the group and his absence is a crippling blow. Especially given the guy is a fantastic friend. <br /> <br /> We'll update when we can, even if it means relegating Lupin to (beloved) NPC status. We just hope that Traffic is okay, and makes contact with us soon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12644-herbertisbestbert","name":"HerbertIsBestBert","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12644_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"312"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-31T11:36:06-07:00","id":1240975,"title":"","content":"Disappeared from the Internet, or disappeared - period? Either way, I hope everything is alright and you get to hear from each other.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-18T07:03:09-08:00","id":1268541,"title":"","content":"So has anyone heard from traffic?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24168-madman777","name":"Madman777","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-18T14:00:56-08:00","id":1268628,"title":"","content":"Unfortunately not.<br /> <br /> We have been venturing forth regardless, and we've had some juicy sessions which we just haven't had the opportunity to convert to a PDF format and post here.<br /> <br /> Actually probably about 2 whole updates worth. We'll post them when we're able.<br /> 2-player games are interesting, and almost always fall into the Buddy Cop dynamic. Which is fantastic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12644-herbertisbestbert","name":"HerbertIsBestBert","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12644_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"312"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-09T05:59:35-08:00","id":1273577,"title":"","content":"Patience, is a virtue.<br /> And whoever's reading this, has been exceedingly virtuous.<br /> I think 7 months of waiting deserves a bit of content, don't you?<br /> <br /> I present to you, the first instalment in the backlog of Boston Lights as I desperately try to catch up with the current sessions, Chapters 2.5 and 3.1<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1CRcNgSc1XHlbI-luCB1E01vvv5BeASrv\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/open?id=1CR...1E01vvv5BeASrv</a><br /> <br /> This is the end of Becoming Foolish, and marks the beginning of the next Chapter in the Arc of Fallen Stones: &quot;Forgotten Lies&quot;<br /> <br /> There is much more to come as I have another 34,000 words of Discord logs to edit into AP-form (about 3 times the length of THIS update), and we're making more all the time.<br /> Forgive any problems with the editing, it was Traffic who did the previous lot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12644-herbertisbestbert","name":"HerbertIsBestBert","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12644_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"312"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-10T16:57:31-08:00","id":1273806,"title":"","content":"Well, I guess I churned out this update rather quickly.<br /> <br /> Here it is, Boston Lights all the way up to our last kind-of session that ended yesterday.<br /> I hope you enjoy it, things have been getting really real for the Cabal, as they dig deeper and deeper into (my verison of) Boston's past.<br /> <br /> Rather than post several PDF documents of the various chapters, I thought I'd just post the complete AP document, with all recent Chapters included.<br /> <br /> If you haven't read 2.5 or 3.1 posted above, then this update totals about 50,000 words, which is roughly an additional 50% of the AP until our hiatus, and contains some really juicy bits.<br /> What's your favorite bit?<br /> <br /> Bon App\u00e8tit<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1XH7PEnhMxtu8v2dG1jEJJ2-iqUIyyQeP\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1XH7PEnhMxtu8v2dG1jEJJ2-iqUIyyQeP\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1XH7PEnhMxtu8v2dG1jEJJ2-iqUIyyQeP\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/open?id=1XH7PEnhMxtu8v2dG1jEJJ2-iqUIyyQeP </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12644-herbertisbestbert","name":"HerbertIsBestBert","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12644_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"312"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-15T11:30:57-08:00","id":1274595,"title":"","content":"This story is excellent! You guys really have grabbed the feeling of Mage here. So, I'm guessing TrafficHazard still hasn't come back, in which case my question is are you all continuing to play without him? And if so, do you have plans for someone else to take over his character? If you don't have plans for someone to take over his character, do you have plans to bring in anyone else? I'm not asking so that I can join, that would be awkward and likely wouldn't work anyways.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7825-falcon777","name":"Falcon777","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-15T15:10:09-08:00","id":1274632,"title":"","content":"Traffic is still sadly gone, and we've largely resigned ourselves to the fact that he's likely not coming back.<br /> <br /> Lupin will still be around (as an NPC), but we've currently got him stuck in Legacy initiation limbo until we can figure out what to do with him.<br /> It's a pity too, because I had great little plots for his pal Caleb and his wish being granted, and for the Cairn Club Anomaly, which don't work well without him.<br /> <br /> We had considered looking for a replacement player, but have been a bit busy, and haven't had the time to vet someone for an ongoing game like this one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12644-herbertisbestbert","name":"HerbertIsBestBert","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12644_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"312"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-21T14:09:50-08:00","id":1275891,"title":"","content":"We dearly miss TH and really do wonder what's going on with him. We hope he's ok. I don't know that it would feel right to replace Lupin's player but I have mentioned on multiple occasions it would be great to bring someone new in. But as Herbert says, there have been time crunches for us all, and none of us are really sure who to approach! At this point we are deeply committed, though, so we've been moving forward as best we can. Herbert is a trooper and CoolStory is a fine gent too. Hit me up if you think you know someone who might be a good fit. It would be good to start talking.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23778-swagdog","name":"swagdog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23778_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}